    <guid isPermaLink="false">6537acf175608281a9eb0b73</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Oct 2023 06:42:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>本期主播：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>给许鞍华做了剪辑的 鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span><li><span>开了新店且看起来很新的 可达鸭</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期嘉宾：</span></h3><span></span><p><span>-偷了许鞍华做剪辑的导演的袜子的 陶典</span></p><span></span><h3><span>本期要点：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>可达鸭的广告时间：我在东京开餐厅啦！叫做丫屋（鲤鱼王对店名亦有贡献）具体地址在shownotes末尾奉上</span></li><span></span><li></li><span></span><li><span>进入正题：</span></li><span></span><li><span>配音演员陶典的代表角色和推荐作品</span></li><span></span><li><span>陶典怎么开始配起百合广播剧的</span></li><span></span><li><span>百合广播剧里也分攻受</span></li><span></span><li><span>小剧场：声优亲自指导大家如何把话讲得油腻</span></li><span></span><li><span>广播剧中，一些有颜色的付费场景如何用声音表现</span></li><span></span><li><span>广播剧领域也没有实现男女同工同酬</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><hr><span></span><p><span>PS：</span></p><span></span><ul><span></span><li><p><span>可达鸭的店铺地址：</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span>丫屋（やーや）東京都新宿区西早稲田1−17−5 タオタビル　2F</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span>营业时间：</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span>平日<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>欢迎大家来用餐，来聊天！如果真的有听友来店，可以明示我可以暗示我，不要偷偷观察我！谢谢大噶！</span></p><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src="https://i.typlog.com/orderapizza/8301870547_051924.jpg" alt="alt text"><span>赛博发出一张电子优惠券，期待大家光临！</span></p><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
