  <item>
    <title>39｜为男人说两句不中听的好话，为“铁T”仗义执言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649525eab971bb75bb6c51d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649525eab971bb75bb6c51d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Jun 2023 04:55:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题承接上期内容，继续探讨《造浪者》，涉及翁文方的亲密关系（为铁T说了大量好话），陈家竞的亲密关系（为男人说了一些好话），最后也为男性创作者说了两句他们听了大概也并不会开心的公道话。最重要的还是，希望看到更多真正属于女性的故事。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>本期嘉宾：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>很容易被影视作品打动的 璀璨者</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期主播：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>支持文方姐冻蒜的 可达鸭</span></li><span></span><li><span>羡慕嫉妒恨的中文创作者 鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期要点：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=00:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></span><span> 把女性神化，浪漫化，对女权主义并无益处</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=05:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></span><span> 把女性之间的亲密关系一味美化，浪漫化，也是一种刻板印象</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=12:24"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a></span></span><span> 假如翁文方是一个"T"的形象</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=16:09"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a></span></span><span> 翁文方和啾啾关系的一大的魅力是两个姐姐，轮流当"攻"</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=23:44"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a></span></span><span> 铁T其实是在突破长久以来某些魅力被男性所垄断的局面</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=26:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a></span></span><span> 异性恋女性如果想要走入亲密关系，找一个善良的人好过一个"女权男"</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=31:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a></span></span><span> 有良知的人最终都会成为女权主义者（小心那些把女权主义当作标签的男性）</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=36:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a></span></span><span> 家竞就是我们现实中能接触到的最接近理想的直男了吗？</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=40:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></span><span> 作为对照的赵夫人，问题和困境都非常典型</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=49:15"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a></span></span><span> 我们如何看待《造浪者》过于理想化的问题</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=53:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a></span></span><span> 该剧结局没有对整个制度进行任何的批评</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=58:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a></span></span><span> 编剧和导演想要打造一个比现实生活中好一点点的平行世界</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=60:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a></span></span><span> 从职场剧角度看待《造浪者》，主创如何让职场细节真实可信</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=64:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a></span></span><span> 建议创作者不要把自己不了解的群体特殊化</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=68:15"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4095">68:15</a></span></span><span> 没有办法创作出生动真实的女性角色，是男性创作者的损失</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=70:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a></span></span><span> 占据强势多数位置的群体应该有把资源和话语权归还给少数群体的意识</span></p><span></span></li><span></span><li><p><span href="#t=75:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">75:00</a></span></span><span> 为什么我们如此喜欢《造浪者》</span></p><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/608560dfeb2645177ab481fb/liKaMciZroC1xV2yOcEjfl2gbaAM.mp3" length="74265567" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:21</itunes:duration>
