  <item>
    <title>38｜展现“不完美受害者”的创作者重生时可以成为人类吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647ffaeb24c2137763bdbef3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647ffaeb24c2137763bdbef3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Jun 2023 03:24:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⚠️ 情绪触发预警：本期节目涉及性暴力受害者的相关内容，可能会触发部分收听者的情绪，请酌情收听。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>本期嘉宾：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>很容易被影视作品打动的 璀璨者</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期主播：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>支持文方姐冻蒜的 可达鸭</span></li><span></span><li><span>羡慕嫉妒恨的中文创作者 鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期要点：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span href="#t=03:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a></span></span><span> 剧情简要介绍，本剧关键词：女性，职场</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=05:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></span><span> 编剧简莉颖的一些无用的个人情报</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=07:09"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a></span></span><span> 关键女性角色简要介绍</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=11:29"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a></span></span><span> 璀璨者认为该剧把张亚静设置成一个不完美的受害者，堪称功德一件</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=21:44"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a></span></span><span> 全局唯一小白兔赵蓉之，真正的成长从和父亲决裂开始</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=32:14"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a></span></span><span> 女性可以从张亚静身上学到的生存智慧：面对有权有势的侵害者，借力打力，挖掘出自己和更强大的组织的共同利益，为己所用</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=39:43"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a></span></span><span> 璀璨者认为，受害者可能会为了夺回对自己身体和思想的控制权，"爱上"加害者</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=43:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a></span></span><span> 一旦受害者真的爱上加害者，受害者会更加孤独无助（提及电影《3096天》）</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=48:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a></span></span><span> 受害者爱上加害者的可能性，只能在讨论如何帮助受害者的角度去谈</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=51:39"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3099">51:39</a></span></span><span> 加害者绝无可能爱受害者，因为加害者剥夺了受害者的主体性</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=57:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a></span></span><span> 打着恋爱旗号的职场性骚扰者，其实都是在利用地位不对等获得对方对于自己的肯定</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=61:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">61:50</a></span></span><span> 女主角翁文方过于完美，因此有点像工具人</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=67:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">67:30</a></span></span><span> 我们东亚女就是可以被父亲轻易的示好感动到泪流满面</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=70:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a></span></span><span> 真正的深沉如海的男性长辈之爱饱含多么充沛的情感能量</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
