  <item>
    <title>36｜在山东酒席上，没有人能随随便便干杯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640577c9d38e79acd0f6c3fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640577c9d38e79acd0f6c3fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Mar 2023 05:14:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>相当相当抱歉！这期节目本来是想给大家拜个晚年的，拖延到现在，只能拜个早年了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家龙年大吉大利！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请了两位和山东血脉相连，执手相牵的嘉宾，一起聊一聊近年来互联网上地域梗的重灾区--山东。周一这天上线，献给所有有编制的，有稳定单位，有五险一金的朋友，也送给广大灵活就业的散户。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>本期嘉宾：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>纯正山东女婿子岩</span></li><span></span><li><span>一位不愿透露姓名的鲁女士</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期主播：</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>山东人民的好邻居可达鸭</span></li><span></span><li><span>很怕一言不慎冒犯山东人民的鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>本期要点</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>磕头篇</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span href="#t=02:26"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a></span></span><span> 山东过年时，两拨人狭路相逢互相磕头的盛况</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=06:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a></span></span><span> 在山东，磕头是孩子对父母表示孝敬的最高形式</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=06:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a></span></span><span> 给父母磕头，也是一个男人成熟懂事的标志</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=09:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a></span></span><span> 结婚时如何“磕出一套首付”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>婚俗篇</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span href="#t=11:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a></span></span><span> 让山东女婿困惑的提亲流程</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=14:35"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a></span></span><span> 山东原教旨主义提亲，女方父母不能出席</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>酒席篇</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span href="#t=17:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a></span></span><span> 山东酒席座次基础讲解</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=18:55"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a></span></span><span> 酒席的节奏把控器—“喝几个”</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=26:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a></span></span><span> 鲁女士血脉觉醒，现场给大家提一个</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=29:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a></span></span><span> 在山东的酒席上，没有人能随随便便干杯</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=32:18"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a></span></span><span> 躲不过的问题：在山东，女性能不能上桌</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>事业学业篇</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span href="#t=39:09"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a></span></span><span> 山东大学，只在清北复交之下</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=40:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></span><span> 山东人不愿出省读大学</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=41:08"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a></span></span><span> 山东人的考公情结：立足山东，目指首都，放眼全国</span></li><span></span><li><span href="#t=43:58"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a></span></span><span> 山东价值体系里的职业地位金字塔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
