  <item>
    <title>33【大人的披萨】日本风俗店赛博游</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630712c5d4cdbb98a2885eb6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">630712c5d4cdbb98a2885eb6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Aug 2022 06:02:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【本期主播】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>在红灯区门口喝咖啡的可达鸭</span></li><span></span><li><span>在红灯区门口张望的 鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>在红灯区的chiyo</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>通过公众号bie的女孩，可达鸭认识了chiyo。在日本留学期间，chiyo探访，体验了日本风俗行业的种种，以独特的方式在夜晚重新认识世界和自己。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>【时间条】</span></h2><span></span><h3><span href="#t=02:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a></span></span><span> 因为看到了百合风俗漫画，决定去风俗店花钱买抱抱</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=04:27"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a></span></span><span> 正是因为喜欢女孩子，所以选择了牛郎店</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=06:14"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a></span></span><span> 在风俗店感受到了他人的好意</span></h3><span></span><h2><span>【夜晚的世界】</span></h2><span></span><h3><span href="#t=08:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a></span></span><span> 喝酒聊天去哪里 girls bar里练口语</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=16:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a></span></span><span> 一旦进入风俗行业就不会只提供亲吻，拥抱</span></h3><span></span><h2><span>【百合店体验】</span></h2><span></span><h3><span href="#t=20:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></span><span> 令人下不去手的百合店网页设计，少妇白洁一字排开，中间穿插一两个油头T</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=25:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></span><span> 第一次指名，小姐姐虚报属性，想把爱好当职业</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=32:02"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a></span></span><span> 第二次指名，遇到了击穿心脏的女孩</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=34:28"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a></span></span><span> 第三次指名，终于被大姐姐酱酱酿酿，被姐姐全方位引导了</span></h3><span></span><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/orderapizza/8338592767_656747.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1125/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/orderapizza/8338592767_656747.jpg" alt="41661406592_.pic.jpg"></picture></figure></div><h2><span>【牛郎店和百合店不是一门生意】</span></h2><span></span><h3><span href="#t=36:29"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a></span></span><span> 女孩之间更共情，也可能会产生情绪负担</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=39:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a></span></span><span> “你是我的姐，你是我唯一的姐。”</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=40:15"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a></span></span><span> “唯一的姐”和牛郎狂，谁的花费更多？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=41:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a></span></span><span> 牛郎行业就是一门生意，百合风俗更接近社群</span></h3><span></span><h2><span>【在风俗店消费的人，是否真的得到了他们想要的？】</span></h2><span></span><h3><span href="#t=43:42"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a></span></span><span> “无论如何都想获得一次性体验”所以走进了风俗店</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=44:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a></span></span><span> 风俗店的消费没有帮助chiyo获得亲密关系，但让她更加认识自己</span></h3><span></span><h2><span>【chiyo的文章阅读连接】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_YGKdMXBArJy5Y1DT8Yqdw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_YGKdMXBArJy5Y1DT8Yqdw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></li><span></span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SBnSHwh7u4LI4UnB5QVKaw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SBnSHwh7u4LI4UnB5QVKaw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
