  <item>
    <title>32 | 学姐你好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bf2dbaf388d4c7cc489c96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62bf2dbaf388d4c7cc489c96</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2022 17:05:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>对女校有复杂感情的 林老师</span></li><span></span><li><span>想整理学姐领结却从未实现过的 长颈鹿</span></li><span></span><li><span>对男女混校充满好奇的 犬黑</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>【本期主播】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>只上过男女混校但莫名有很多女校朋友的 鲤鱼王</span></li><span></span><li><span>本来只想看热闹但吧啦吧啦吧啦吧吧啦吧啦吧的 可达鸭</span></li><span></span><li></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>【本期要点】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>三位嘉宾分别在不同的学龄段，在不同的地区上过女校。</span></p><span></span><h3><span href="#t=02:02"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a></span></span><span> 三位嘉宾怎么会进入女校？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=09:06"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a></span></span><span> 大家对女校有什么想象？</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>长颈鹿：水池，圣母玛利亚雕像，和带着领结的学姐</span></li><span></span><li><span>林老师：压力好大</span></li><span></span><li><span>犬黑：小学一年级入学就有人全英文自我介绍，震撼犬黑及其全家，人生第一次意识到，什么叫做“卷”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span href="#t=14:45"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a></span></span><span> 女校刻板印象大验证</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=14:55"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a></span></span><span> 可达鸭：女校里上女厕所是不是不用排队？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=16:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a></span></span><span> 在女校，卫生棉在教室里飞来飞去</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=20:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a></span></span><span> 女校中的男老师似乎都很快乐</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=23:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a></span></span><span> 女校中有没有师生间的绯闻</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=24:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a></span></span><span> 事后回看，女校的环境给青春期的林老师提供了安全感</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=28:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a></span></span><span> 长颈鹿对比男女混校和女性之间的差异，不再对月经有耻感，</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=31:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a></span></span><span> 女校里，学生更喜欢勾心斗角吗？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=31:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a></span></span><span> 女校里，也会有身体羞辱和霸凌</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=35:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a></span></span><span> 对于大部分人来说，青春期就是很辛苦，在什么学校都一样</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=38:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a></span></span><span> 让我们直接进入到和学姐谈恋爱的环节吧</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=40:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></span><span> 女校毕业生不见得会对于LGBTQ群体更加友好</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=48:05"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a></span></span><span> 女校中的风云人物，和男女混校有什么区别？跳街舞，会乐器，会打球</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=56:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a></span></span><span> 女校是封建遗留产物吗？男女分校的历史源流</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:01:01"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">1:01:01</a></span></span><span> 女校到底旨在培养娇妻还是独立女性？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:02:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3740">1:02:20</a></span></span><span> 鲤鱼王观察到，身边很多女校毕业生朋友都很有领导力，甚至被认为“强势”</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:03:03"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">1:03:03</a></span></span><span> 犬黑认为，女校毕业生某种程度上确实更加”耿直“</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:08:39"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">1:08:39</a></span></span><span> 林老师眼中的“女校大小姐”</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:12:10"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4330">1:12:10</a></span></span><span> 进入到男女混校或性别比例更均衡的社会环境后，最开始有没有不适应？</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:17:10"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4630">1:17:10</a></span></span><span> 犬黑发出天问，真的不懂直男在想什么！</span></h3><span></span><h3><span href="#t=1:18:01"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4681">1:18:01</a></span></span><span> 女性留给三位嘉宾的影响和遗产</span></h3><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza" data-url="https://afdian.net/@orderapizza"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
